  <section class="section"><article class="container prose">
    <h2>Media owner and service provider</h2>
    <address class="legal-address"><strong>Emanuele Viglianisi</strong><br />Altenbauerstraße 12<br />4060 Leonding<br />Austria</address>
    <dl class="legal-details"><dt>Email</dt><dd><a href="mailto:emavgl.app@gmail.com">emavgl.app@gmail.com</a></dd><dt>Responsible for content</dt><dd>Emanuele Viglianisi, at the address stated above.</dd></dl>
    <h2>Business activity</h2><p>Development, provision, and distribution of Ascuta voice-typing software, and operation of this website.</p>
    <h2>Consumer and legal information</h2><p>This website is informational and does not operate a checkout or process payments. Ascuta's software and any third-party services remain subject to their applicable terms and licenses. For data handling, see the <a href={`${base}privacy-policy`}>Privacy Policy</a>; for use of the software, see the <a href={`${base}terms`}>Terms &amp; Conditions</a>.</p>
